sequenceDiagram
  actor User as 授权用户
  participant Host as 原生控件和权限broker
  participant API as 后端会话与命令API
  participant Exec as 统一命令执行器
  participant DB as SQLite repair.db
  User->>Host: 确认接单或预约动作
  Host->>API: Bearer + Idempotency-Key + expected_version + payload
  API->>Exec: 可信actor与项目范围
  Exec->>DB: BEGIN IMMEDIATE
  Exec->>DB: 检查幂等键和请求摘要
  alt 同键同请求已处理
    DB-->>Exec: 原回执（不重复执行）
  else 新请求
    Exec->>DB: 读取当前任务版本、承接者、状态
    Note over Exec,DB: accept_task只允许一个承接者
    Note over Exec,DB: confirm_appointment核验提议有效期和同技工半开区间冲突
    Exec->>DB: 写任务/预约 + action + event + 通知记录
    Exec->>DB: COMMIT（异常则全部ROLLBACK）
    DB-->>Exec: action_id / task_version / event_seq
  end
  Exec-->>API: 原回执或新回执
  API-->>Host: 200回执或明确的4xx错误
  Host->>API: GET最新角色化任务投影
  API-->>Host: 服务器事实与allowed_actions
  Note over Host,DB: 断线/响应丢失用同键核对；不在本地假设成功
